{"date": "2026-11-05", "word": null, "summary": "The upslope ran from about 08:45 to about 16:30. The evening before, the page called it normal, about 5,000 ft, a hit. Midday the base averaged about 5,000 ft by the Kekoa camera, right on the evening's number; the morning update said about 5,000 ft and was right on. Most of the day the shear line was crossing Kula Highway near Omaopio; furthest north about 14:52, crossing Kula Highway near Kamehameha Schools; furthest south about 17:22, crossing Kula Highway at the middle Lower Kula Road junction. Data gaps: no readings all day from 1 station (Nakula); the Mesonet could not be reached on 18 of 52 updates.", "therm": "Unavailable", "base": "", "notes": ["The cloud decayed from the base up from about 15:15.", "Watched for: Late-day decay (P7) from 16:26.", "Camera against derived: morning about 400 ft higher, midday within 200 ft, afternoon about 300 ft lower."], "chart": "<div class=\"watch\"><div class=\"kind\">What the day did</div><ul><li>The cloud decayed from the base up from about 15:15.</li><li>Watched for: Late-day decay (P7) from 16:26.</li><li>Camera against derived: morning about 400 ft higher, midday within 200 ft, afternoon about 300 ft lower.</li></ul></div><div style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:.9rem;margin:10px 0 2px\">Cloudbase</div><div style=\"display:flex;gap:14px;flex-wrap:wrap;font-size:.8rem;color:var(--muted,#6b6b66);margin:2px 0 4px\">\n<span><span style=\"display:inline-block;width:16px;border-top:2px dashed #8a5cd6;vertical-align:middle\"></span> Forecast (sounding)</span>\n<span><span style=\"display:inline-block;width:16px;height:2px;background:#2a78d6;vertical-align:middle\"></span> Derived (stations)</span><span><span style=\"display:inline-block;width:8px;height:8px;border-radius:50%;background:#3f9d5a;vertical-align:middle\"></span> Kekoa camera</span><span><span style=\"display:inline-block;width:8px;height:8px;border-radius:50%;border:1.5px solid #898781;box-sizing:border-box;vertical-align:middle\"></span> Camera, no call</span></div>\n<div style=\"position:relative;width:100%;min-width:0;height:220px\"><canvas id=\"basechart\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Derived cloudbase through the day\"></canvas></div>\n<div class=\"sub\">Derived from the stations every 15 minutes during the upslope. Forecast: the RRFS Kahului sounding (run 05 12Z), its air at Kula Ag&#x27;s height lifted to condensation, hour by hour.</div>\n<script>\n(function () {\n  var d = {\"derived\": [[540, 4010.0], [555, 4120.0], [570, 4120.0], [585, 3950.0], [600, 3970.0], [615, 4120.0], [630, 4230.0], [645, 4250.0], [660, 4360.0], [675, 4500.0], [690, 4660.0], [705, 4860.0], [720, 4830.0], [735, 4820.0], [750, 5100.0], [765, 5080.0], [780, 5260.0], [795, 5300.0], [810, 5350.0], [825, 5120.0], [840, 4980.0], [855, 4910.0], [870, 4950.0], [885, 4890.0], [900, 5060.0], [915, 5150.0], [930, 5160.0], [945, 5190.0], [960, 5180.0]], \"forecast\": [], \"camera\": [[555, 4390.0], [564, 5280.0], [581, 5740.0], [590, 5600.0], [598, 5100.0], [607, 3650.0], [615, 4050.0], [624, 4410.0], [632, 3620.0], [641, 5080.0], [649, 3400.0], [658, 4260.0], [667, 4730.0], [675, 5010.0], [719, 5190.0], [727, 3920.0], [745, 3440.0], [780, 5470.0], [789, 5640.0], [797, 5580.0], [806, 5520.0], [815, 5480.0], [823, 5210.0], [832, 5210.0], [858, 5070.0], [866, 5070.0], [875, 5050.0], [883, 4890.0], [892, 5210.0], [901, 5080.0], [926, 5470.0], [935, 3810.0], [943, 3720.0], [952, 4150.0]], \"hidden\": [], \"proj\": [[540, 4290.0], [600, 4360.0], [660, 4740.0], [720, 3820.0], [780, 4370.0], [840, 3790.0], [900, 3250.0], [960, 3490.0]], \"nocall\": [693, 702, 711, 736, 840, 849, 909, 918], \"up\": [540, 960], \"nocu\": null}, pt = function (a) { return {x: a[0], y: a[1]}; };\n  var dark = matchMedia('(prefers-color-scheme: dark)').matches, muted = '#898781', grid = dark ? '#2c2c2a' : '#e1e0d9';\n  var nocu = { id: 'nocu', beforeDatasetsDraw: function (c) { if (!d.nocu) return; var x = c.scales.x, a = c.chartArea, g = c.ctx,\n    x0 = x.getPixelForValue(d.nocu[0]), x1 = x.getPixelForValue(d.nocu[1]);\n    g.save(); g.fillStyle = 'rgba(137,135,129,0.10)'; g.fillRect(x0, a.top, x1 - x0, a.bottom - a.top);\n    g.fillStyle = muted; g.font = '11px sans-serif'; g.textAlign = 'center';\n    g.fillText('No cumulus', (x0 + x1) / 2, a.top + (a.bottom - a.top) / 2); g.restore(); } };\n  var band = { id: 'band', beforeDatasetsDraw: function (c) { if (!d.up) return; var x = c.scales.x, a = c.chartArea, g = c.ctx;\n    g.save(); g.fillStyle = 'rgba(137,135,129,0.14)';\n    g.fillRect(x.getPixelForValue(d.up[0]), a.top, x.getPixelForValue(d.up[1]) - x.getPixelForValue(d.up[0]), a.bottom - a.top); g.restore(); } };\n  // Landmarks on the slope (Sam, 10-31): dashed lines across the chart.\n  var marks = { id: 'marks', beforeDatasetsDraw: function (c) { var y = c.scales.y, a = c.chartArea, g = c.ctx;\n    [[4600, 'Treeline'], [6200, 'Ferns']].forEach(function (m) {\n      if (m[0] < y.min || m[0] > y.max) return; var py = y.getPixelForValue(m[0]);\n      g.save(); g.strokeStyle = muted; g.lineWidth = 1; g.setLineDash([4, 4]);\n      g.beginPath(); g.moveTo(a.left, py); g.lineTo(a.right, py); g.stroke();\n      g.setLineDash([]); g.fillStyle = muted; g.font = '11px sans-serif'; g.textAlign = 'right';\n      g.fillText(m[1], a.right - 4, py - 4); g.restore(); }); } };\n  var hm = function (m) { return String(Math.floor(m / 60)).padStart(2, '0') + ':' + String(m % 60).padStart(2, '0'); };\n  var ys = d.derived.map(function (a) { return a[1]; }).concat(d.forecast.map(function (a) { return a[1]; })).concat(d.camera.map(function (a) { return a[1]; })).concat(d.proj.map(function (a) { return a[1]; }));\n  var xs = [540, 960];\n  var ymin = Math.min(3500, Math.floor(Math.min.apply(null, ys) / 500) * 500);\n  new Chart(document.getElementById('basechart'), {\n    type: 'line',\n    data: { datasets: [\n      { label: 'Derived', data: d.derived.map(pt), borderColor: '#2a78d6', borderWidth: 2, pointRadius: 0, tension: 0.3 },\n      { label: 'Forecast', data: d.forecast.map(pt), borderColor: '#eb6834', borderWidth: 2, borderDash: [6, 4], pointRadius: 3, pointBackgroundColor: '#eb6834', tension: 0.3 },\n      { label: 'Forecast (sounding)', data: d.proj.map(pt), borderColor: '#8a5cd6', borderWidth: 2, borderDash: [3, 4], pointRadius: 0, tension: 0.3 },\n      { label: 'Kekoa camera', data: d.camera.map(pt), showLine: false, pointRadius: 3, pointBackgroundColor: '#3f9d5a', borderColor: '#3f9d5a' },\n      { label: 'Camera hidden', data: d.hidden.map(function (m) { return {x: m, y: ymin}; }), showLine: false, clip: false,\n         pointRadius: 3, pointBackgroundColor: '#e0a100', borderColor: '#e0a100' },\n      { label: 'Camera, no call', data: d.nocall.map(function (m) { return {x: m, y: ymin}; }), showLine: false, clip: false,\n         pointRadius: 3, pointBorderWidth: 1.5, pointBackgroundColor: 'rgba(0,0,0,0)', borderColor: muted }\n    ] },\n    options: { responsive: true, maintainAspectRatio: false, interaction: { mode: 'nearest', axis: 'x', intersect: false },\n      plugins: { legend: { display: false }, tooltip: { callbacks: {\n        title: function (i) { return hm(i[0].parsed.x); },\n        label: function (i) { return i.dataset.label === 'Camera hidden' ? 'Camera hidden: cloud or rain at the camera'\n          : i.dataset.label === 'Camera, no call' ? 'Camera: no call'\n          : i.dataset.label + ': ' + Math.round(i.parsed.y).toLocaleString() + ' ft'; } } } },\n      scales: {\n        x: { type: 'linear', min: xs[0], max: xs[1], ticks: { stepSize: 60, color: muted, callback: function (v) { return hm(v); } }, grid: { display: false } },\n        y: { min: ymin,\n              max: Math.max(7000, Math.ceil(Math.max.apply(null, ys) / 500) * 500),\n              ticks: { stepSize: 500, color: muted, callback: function (v) { return v.toLocaleString(); } }, grid: { color: grid } }\n      } },\n    plugins: [nocu, marks]\n  });\n})();\n</script>", "line": 